    <p>Over ₹4 lakh lost — on a ₹5,000 monthly SIP. Increase that SIP to ₹15,000 per month and the gap triples to over ₹12 lakh. Extend the tenure to 20 years and the numbers become even more dramatic. Use <a href="/india/sip-calculator/">CalcPhi's SIP Calculator</a> to compare results at two different return rates and see the compounding impact of the expense ratio difference for your own numbers.</p>

